# CRITICAL DEPLOYMENT INFORMATION

## AUTOMATED DEPLOYMENT PROCESS

Local → GitHub → [AUTO] → Qual → [MANUAL] → Production

How it works:
- Push to main = Auto-deploy to qual/staging
- Production = Manual trigger via GitHub Actions

Setup Required:
- Add SSH_PRIVATE_KEY to GitHub secrets
- See .github/workflows/README.md

NEVER:
- Deploy directly to production without qual testing
- Remove console.logs (breaks the code)
- Create new deployment methods

See /DEPLOYMENT.md for details.